From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Chia-Lin Kao (AceLan)" <acelan.kao@canonical.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Dec 2025 13:04:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: r8169: Add more Dell platforms to enable ASPM

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2133144

This patch adds more Dell product families to the allowlist for enabling
RTL NIC PCIe ASPM. These new platforms have been verified to work
reliably with ASPM enabled.

The new product families are:
- Dell Pro Precision
- Dell Pro Essential
- Dell Pro Education
- XPS

Signed-off-by: Chia-Lin Kao (AceLan) <acelan.kao@canonical.com>
(follow-up commit for https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20250912072939.2553835-1-acelan.kao@canonical.com/)
Signed-off-by: Chia-Lin Kao (AceLan) <acelan.kao@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Kuan-Ying Lee <kuan-ying.lee@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Kuan-Ying Lee <kuan-ying.lee@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00118
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@e57ce4b86ef0ab4c20a66bfd9548a688080d1d84
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c
index 8575318fcf31..9bcfa16cf27c 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c
@@ -5607,7 +5607,11 @@ static bool rtl_aspm_new_dell_platforms(void)
 		"Dell Desktops",
 		"Dell Pro Desktops",
 		"Dell Pro Max Desktops",
-		"Dell Pro Rugged Laptops"
+		"Dell Pro Rugged Laptops",
+		"Dell Pro Precision",
+		"Dell Pro Essential",
+		"Dell Pro Education",
+		"XPS"
 	};
 	int i;
 
